{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "budgeteer-auth-collection",
		"name": "Budgeteer Auth",
		"description": "Authentication endpoints for Budgeteer app.\n\n## Quick Start (Dev)\n1. Use **Dev Tools > Quick Login** - no magic link needed!\n2. Tokens are auto-saved to environment\n3. Use authenticated endpoints (cookies OR Bearer token)\n\n## Auth Methods\n- **Cookies**: Browser-style auth (automatic)\n- **Bearer Token**: `Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}`\n\n## Production Flow\n1. Request Magic Link (Login)\n2. Copy token from server console\n3. Verify Magic Link\n4. Use authenticated endpoints\n\n## Notes\n- Magic links expire in 30 minutes (dev) / 15 minutes (prod)\n- Access tokens expire in 1 hour (dev) / 15 minutes (prod)\n- Refresh tokens expire in 30 days (dev) / 7 days (prod)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Health",
			"item": [
