			"description": "Monzo bank account integration endpoints.\n\n## OAuth Flow (Browser-Based)\n1. **Quick Login** first (Dev Tools)\n2. **Check Status** - see if already connected\n3. **Initiate OAuth** - get authorization URL\n4. Open URL in browser → approve in Monzo app\n5. Browser redirects to /callback → Server handles it automatically\n6. ✅ Connection created!\n\n## Frontend Endpoints (Postman Testable)\n- **Check Status** - GET /api/monzo/status\n- **Initiate OAuth** - POST /api/monzo/connect\n- **List Connections** - GET /api/monzo/connections\n- **Get Details** - GET /api/monzo/connections/{id}\n- **Disconnect** - DELETE /api/monzo/connections/{id}\n\n## Server-Handled (NOT for Postman)\n- GET /api/monzo/callback - Called by browser redirect from Monzo\n  - Error cases tested via integration tests (MonzoOAuthFlowIT)"
		},
